    "Heat the oil in a non-stick frying pan over medium heat.",
    "Spoon portions of the batter into the pan to form small pancakes, about 8cm wide.",
    "Cook for 2 to 3 minutes until the undersides are golden, then flip and cook for another 2 minutes.",
    "Transfer to a plate and serve warm."
